<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Achadões - Grupo VIP</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Entre no Grupo VIP do Achadões no WhatsApp." />
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff4d6, #ffcc4d, #ff9f1c);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      color: #1f1f1f;
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 430px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 54px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #111;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      color: #444;
    }

    .button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      background: #25d366;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.35);
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
    }

    .button:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
      filter: brightness(0.95);
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="logo">🦁</div>
    <h1>Grupo VIP Achadões</h1>
    <p>Entre no grupo e receba ofertas, cupons e promoções selecionadas.</p>

    <a class="button" href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/CaOd6MzQn3u6XMFp3Nkxey?mode=gi_t" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      ENTRAR NO GRUPO VIP 📲
    </a>

    <div class="note">Toque no botão acima para abrir no WhatsApp.</div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
